internal-warehouse template

Inherits everything from public-warehouse with these overrides:

1. meta.yaml.template:
   - tier: internal
   - exposed_to.public: false
   - backup destination: b2://nexural-private-backup/

2. LICENSE: proprietary
   Replace MIT License text with:
   "All Rights Reserved
   Copyright (c) {{YEAR}} Sage Ideas LLC
   Proprietary. Internal use only."

3. README:
   - Tier badge says "internal"
   - No public scorecard URL

4. GitHub repo:
   - Visibility: private
   - Topic: nexural-factory (or lifeops as appropriate)

`nx new <name> --tier=internal` applies these overrides automatically.
